    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare lattice regularity and topology across silica-, celestite- and organic-skeleton taxa using standardized images, then test whether material predicts form after phylogeny and size are controlled. Demonstrating an underlying vesicular template requires direct developmental imaging rather than cross-material convergence alone.";
