    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Cross-material convergence is not unique evidence for vesicle moulding.", "The groups differ in phylogeny, ecology and scale.";
